<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Commission confirmed</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; background: #faf9f7; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); }
    .header { background: #3d2b1f; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #f5e6d3; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .header p { color: #c8a882; margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .body { padding: 40px; color: #3d2b1f; line-height: 1.7; }
    .body h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0; }
    .earn-block { text-align: center; background: #f5e6d3; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 20px; margin: 24px 0; }
    .earn-block .amount { font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; color: #3d2b1f; line-height: 1.1; }
    .earn-block .sub { font-size: 13px; color: #7a5c45; margin-top: 6px; }
    .detail-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0e8de; font-size: 14px; }
    .detail-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .detail-row .label { color: #7a5c45; }
    .detail-row .value { font-weight: bold; color: #3d2b1f; }
    .cta { display: inline-block; margin: 24px 0; background: #3d2b1f; color: #f5e6d3 !important; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; }
    .footer { background: #f5e6d3; padding: 20px 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #7a5c45; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🍁 EziHubb</h1>
      <p>Affiliate Program</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Great news, {{firstName}}!</h2>
      <p>Your commission for a referred order has cleared the review period and has been confirmed.</p>

      <div class="earn-block">
        <div class="amount">+${{amount}}</div>
        <div class="sub">added to your balance</div>
      </div>

      <div style="background:#faf9f7; border-radius:6px; padding:16px 20px; margin-bottom:24px;">
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="label">Order</span>
          <span class="value">#{{orderNumber}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="label">Commission earned</span>
          <span class="value">${{amount}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="label">Your balance</span>
          <span class="value">${{balance}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="label">Payout minimum</span>
          <span class="value">${{minPayout}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      {{#if canPayout}}
      <p>You've reached the payout minimum — you can request a payout right now.</p>
      {{else}}
      <p>You can request a payout once your balance reaches ${{minPayout}}. Keep sharing your referral link to get there faster.</p>
      {{/if}}

      <a class="cta" href="{{payoutsUrl}}">View your earnings →</a>

      <p>Warmly,<br /><strong>The EziHubb Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} EziHubb. All rights reserved.<br />
      You're receiving this email as a EziHubb affiliate.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
